# External I2C OLED

The header OLED is an **SH1106** 128×64 at `0x3C` (also accept `0x3D`). Sellers often label it SSD1306. Full notes: technical spec §4.9. Reference sketch: `oled-hello/`.

| OLED | Header |
|------|--------|
| VCC | 3V3 (never VSYS) |
| GND | GND |
| SDA | GPIO18 |
| SCL | GPIO8 |

Drive it with U8g2 `U8G2_SH1106_128X64_NONAME_F_HW_I2C` (column offset 2). An SSD1306 driver leaves a 2-pixel line on the right edge. That line is unused SH1106 columns (132-wide RAM, 128-wide glass), not a broken panel.

```cpp
U8G2_SH1106_128X64_NONAME_F_HW_I2C display(
    U8G2_R0, U8X8_PIN_NONE, /* clock */ 8, /* data */ 18);
```
